Well, in theory in general, every sentence is derived from a formula.  The =
question is whether we can automatically derive that formula from the sente=
nce. The best (only?) way to test this is to see whether the formula team 2=
 derives from a sentence supplied by team 1 is the same formula that team 1=
 used to derive the sentence in the first place.  A weaker test is to see w=
hether the automatically derived formula corresponds to the intuitive readi=
ng of the sentence as provided by proficient speakers who re logically soph=
isticated, etc.

